    Tycho compiles against OSGi Require-Bundle (see pom-first.xml / MANIFEST.MF).
    These provided deps are for IDE/m2e/JDT only so imports like
    org.apache.directory.api.ldap.model.ldif.LdifEntry and Eclipse content
    describer APIs resolve in Cursor/VS Code.
  -->
